dth=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">152m</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Q Max.</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">84 m3/h</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Motor Power</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">4-22 kW/ 5-30HP</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Phase</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Three Phase/ Single Phase</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Item Shape</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Round</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Max. Diameter</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">143 mm</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Pump Length</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">1161-2522 mm in this series</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Outlet Connection Size</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3-4 inches</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Voltage</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220-240/380-415 volts, 50Hz</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Highest temperature water</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">35℃</p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"166\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Warranty Description</p></td><td width=\"354\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">12 Months</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270859573503898.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808270900021363226.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image011.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Production Application</strong></p><p>JIADI pumps can be applied